"value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-01T07:51:10-08:00","id":1364536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p=1364521#post1364521\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The only preview we have so far is the chapter list.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah ok, I thought that was something they shared on google drive or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25877-mithras304","name":"Mithras304","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25877_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-16T04:25:33-07:00","id":1375057,"title":"","content":"Anyone really anxious to get this book because of the corona-virus shutdown? I really am looking forward to its contents because I hope it'll give my gaming group something to distract itself from during the crisis.<br /> <br /> GARY, INDIANA is a place that I look forward to visiting again too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-16T04:29:18-07:00","id":1375058,"title":"","content":"Totally looking forward to it. I miss playing my Tremere (Charity).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-16T04:36:25-07:00","id":1375061,"title":"","content":"What I THINK can be found in the book from all the sources (i.e. Matthew Dawkins tidbits on Twitter and in interviews) I can accumulate. Some of this may be inaccurate and, if so, please forgive me.<br /> <br /> 0. This is a Chronicle supplement with 4 full-sized chronicles similar to <b>The Sacrifice</b> set in the Chicago and surrounding area.<br /> <br /> 1. <b>Power Prey</b> is a game set in the Chicago suburbs. I don't know what that one is going to be about but I'm anxious to find out. I could be mixing this up with<b> Innocence in Blood</b>, though as I don't know which is which.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>The Dying Fields</b>: Is a Chronicle where the player characters go to the middle of nowhere in Illinois and they proceed to encounter a weird cult where Kindred serve. It's going to be sort of an American version of The Wicker Man or Midsommar I think. Or maybe that Supernatural episode in the 1st season where they sacrificed people to a scarecrow god. I'm really excited about this one, I've got to tell you.<br /> <br /> 3. <b>Innocence in Blood</b> is the one I believe to be about revisiting Milwaukee and visiting Indianapolis. Mark Decker is now the Prince of Milwaukee and runs a ruthless police state that has all but wiped out the Anarchs in his city as well as abolished the Primogen. Indianapolis, by contrast, is a Church of Caine run Anarch domain with the Ministry being the powers behind the throne. Some fascinating characters too.<br /> <br /> 4. <b>Rusted Jungle</b>: The one that everyone is looking forward to. The Gary Chronicle. We've heard that it will bring back <b>Modius</b>, <b>Juggler</b>, <b>Allicia</b>, and <b>Evelyn</b>. It's also some kind of mystery and I'm eager to see how it updates the setting to 2020.<br /> <br /> 5. <b>Maxwell</b> and <b>Eletria</b>'s fates will be discussed in this book.<br /> <br /> 6. The book size is apparently something like 260 or so pages, which is a fairly large full-sized supplement.<br /> <br /> 7. It's going to be available via PRINT ON DEMAND despite the restrictions imposed by Modiphius and thus will be able to go on people's bookshelves.<br /> <br /> 8. We will be receiving some more Loresheets and I'm eagerly hoping it'll include some Gary ones (but we knew that). It almost certainly will have some Milwaukee ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-