]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T02:19:41-07:00","id":1387667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Redwulfe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p=1378918#post1378918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was in their first announcement of the book here: [URL=&quot;https://www.modiphius.com/modiphius-press-releases/modiphius-launches-v5-organised-play-program-new-v5-books-announced&quot;]https://www.modiphius.com/modiphius-...ooks-announced</div> </div> </div> </div>First announcement was via facebook on december 2018 for Summer 2019 (source: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Modiphius/photos/a.352887401421054/2085024428207334/?type=3\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/Modiphius/p...207334/?type=3</a>)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">V5 Players Guide (Summer 2019) \u2013 A guide to playing different styles of Vampire: The Masquerade to help you play the way YOU want to play, from gritty street level drama to romantic blood opera, complete with advice, new rules, and guidance on using the 5th Edition system to play previous editions of Vampire..</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">V5 Starter Set - (Christmas 2019) - An introductory starter set containing rules to play a self-contained campaign, with premade characters, handouts, maps, tokens and dice.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>Then it was delayed in the source you quoted. I think they had to announce somethink to calm down the disappointed fans, but then other published announced stuff, so they had to reschedule.<br /> <br /> Or, maybe, they didn't know much about vampire so they had to catch up with Paradox. They also announced VTM miniatures (WTF?) for spring 2019.<br /> <br /> Modiphus is clearly focused on Fallout, Star Trek, Conan. Maybe Vampire is not their forte.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T03:44:24-07:00","id":1387678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Riccardo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p=1387667#post1387667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Modiphus is clearly focused on Fallout, Star Trek, Conan. Maybe Vampire is not their forte.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm a bit miffed at Modiphius currently because of the fact they've said they don't want Onyx Path doing any more POD books for the Kickstarter add-ons.<br /> <br /> But I can understand if some of the slowdown is due to the complicated issues of licensing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.