have just 6 books (maybe 8, if Cults of the Blood Gods and Let the streets run red will be out before August)<br /> <br /> At 2 years from the relase of the corebook the second edition had 18 books , and Revised had 23 books (without taking in account the novels).<br /> We are almost 2 years from the debut and still we lack a lot of Clans, Sabbat,rules for elders or alternatives to touchstones and humanity.<br /> Jesus, we still don't have the book about the Second Inquisition, which is a core piece of the new setting.<br /> Things are going veeeeeery slow. (And they were slow even before Covid, now they will only be slower).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 05-12-2020, 09:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T10:34:09-07:00","id":1387760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p=1387698#post1387698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">V5 until now has been much slower in releasing supplements than previous editions. This august it will be 2 years since the debut of Vampire 5th edition, and we have just 6 books (maybe 8, if Cults of the Blood Gods and Let the streets run red will be out before August)</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a homeopatic reboot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T12:14:29-07:00","id":1387776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p=1387698#post1387698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">V5 until now has been much slower in releasing supplements than previous editions. This august it will be 2 years since the debut of Vampire 5th edition, and we have just 6 books (maybe 8, if Cults of the Blood Gods and Let the streets run red will be out before August)<br /> <br /> At 2 years from the relase of the corebook the second edition had 18 books , and Revised had 23 books (without taking in account the novels).<br /> We are almost 2 years from the debut and still we lack a lot of Clans, Sabbat,rules for elders or alternatives to touchstones and humanity.<br /> Jesus, we still don't have the book about the Second Inquisition, which is a core piece of the new setting.<br /> Things are going veeeeeery slow. (And they were slow even before Covid, now they will only be slower).</div> </div> </div> </div>Ehhhhhhhhhh.<br /> <br /> We're also getting/have gotten:<br /> <br /> * Vampire: The Masquerade