/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-14T19:11:40-07:00","id":1396577,"title":"","content":"Did we ever get an &quot;official&quot; accounting of Lorraine Matthews? Lodin's childe? We know Peterson is an exile, Schumpeter 'disappeared' either in the hands of the S.I. or he suffered Final Death, but Lorraine- conspicuously nothing. She was a &quot;survivor&quot; after Chicago By Night second edition, and I didn't find any reference in either Chicago V5 or the Folios regarding her fate. I doubt she's involved in Let the Streets Run Red, though upon publication that could prove me wrong. What happened to Lorraine Matthews who purportly had some of Lodin's files, which is a bit of a treasure trove, and since Lodin loved her, her fate isn't insignificant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24582-ruthven","name":"Ruthven","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-14T19:22:53-07:00","id":1396583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ruthven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p=1396577#post1396577\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did we ever get an &quot;official&quot; accounting of Lorraine Matthews? Lodin's childe? We know Peterson is an exile, Schumpeter 'disappeared' either in the hands of the S.I. or he suffered Final Death, but Lorraine- conspicuously nothing. She was a &quot;survivor&quot; after Chicago By Night second edition, and I didn't find any reference in either Chicago V5 or the Folios regarding her fate. I doubt she's involved in Let the Streets Run Red, though upon publication that could prove me wrong. What happened to Lorraine Matthews who purportly had some of Lodin's files, which is a bit of a treasure trove, and since Lodin loved her, her fate isn't insignificant.</div> </div> </div> </div>I noticed, too, that she was conspicuously absent. Mind you, I could easily see her being killed by Kevin Jackson or being held prisoner by Jackson to force the secrets out of her.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I'm now imagining Cedrick Calhoun assuming Lodin's appearance to interrogate her.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-14T19:34:39-07:00","id":1396588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p=1396583#post1396583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I noticed, too, that she was conspicuously absent. Mind you, I could easily see her being killed by Kevin Jackson or being held prisoner by Jackson to force the secrets out of her.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I'm now imagining Cedrick Calhoun assuming Lodin's appearance to interrogate her.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I could see Kevin Jackson killing her or imprisoner her too, thus part of the explanation of his acquisition of Lodin's previous files. She's a bit of a &quot;low hanging fruit&quot; for Jackson to pluck. She does come from a wealthy family, so her disappearance might create a bit of paparazzi fanfare, at least briefly. Jackson though, does press pause when it comes to Kindred of his own clan, and while he might decide a Kindred or two, might have to take a fall from his own clan. I can't imagine Lorraine would provoke any actual hostility from him, at least not how it was left after Chicago 2nd edition. I'm thinking her fate could play into a storyline with the...um, &quot;Fisher King&quot;, almost obsessively so. Maybe, she was captured, and not having any real reason to destroy her, staked her? Maybe she and Victoria Longwood are languishing wherever staked vampires go under the current Prince?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24582-ruthven","name":"Ruthven","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T00:11:02-07:00","id":1396621,"title":"","content":"The Online Convention said that LET THE STREETS RUN RED's layout MAY be finished now.<br /> <br /> Wee!<br /> <br /> Now it's onto proofing!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digit