nt":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-23T12:14:54-07:00","id":1415220,"title":"","content":"<b>Speculation for LET THE STREETS RUN RED</b><br /> <br /> * The sex-dungeon guy with a battle ax is Walter Nash's ghoul and he's into some kinky stuff.<br /> <br /> * Walter Nash is a renegade childe of Lodin (he had dozens) and once tried to overthrow his sire.<br /> <br /> * Eletria will be the secret master of the cult in the middle of nowhere. She's gone full Bahari.<br /> <br /> * The cult will be tied to the Drowned Gods mentioned in Chicago by Night 5th Edition and Nerissa<br /> .<br /> * Alternatively, Eletria is dead and has been diablerized by one of the characters within.<br /> <br /> * The player characters will choose to ally with the Camarilla or Anarchs based on whether they choose to turn over the wayward progeny to Milwaukee or Indianapolis' kindred.<br /> <br /> * Jacob and Esau are behind the two cities being diametrically opposed to to one another. Jacob controls Milwaukee and Esau controls Indianapolis.<br /> <br /> * We'll get to travel the Goblin Roads between Indianapolis and Milwaukee.<br /> <br /> * The Indianapolis Anarchs are just a front for the Church of Set NOT the Ministry.<br /> <br /> * Sullivan Dane will show up in Gary's chronicle.<br /> <br /> * The focus of the campaign will be the missing Prince and Baron of Gary.<br /> <br /> * We're going to see at least some of the Gary Kindred from <i>Rusted Veins</i> and &quot;The Sacrifice&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=153598