con b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Urban Dictiorary</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <a href=\"https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=Backpfeifengesicht\" target=\"_blank\">Backpfeifengesicht</a><br /> A German <a href=\"https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=compound%20word\" target=\"_blank\">compound word</a>/term that <a href=\"https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=loosely\" target=\"_blank\">loosely</a> translates to &quot;Cheek pipe face&quot;.<br /> <br /> In common use it means something to the effect of &quot;A face badly in need of a fist&quot; meaning this is a person that needs to be punched. Alternate translations list the given action as &quot;slap&quot; rather than &quot;punch&quot; or the given weapon as &quot;<a href=\"https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=crowbar\" target=\"_blank\">crowbar</a>&quot; rather than &quot;fist&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Has he been mentioned anywhere else as Prince of Chicago?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-23T12:36:19-07:00","id":1415225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p