<span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T13:16:52-07:00","id":1420317,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1363026-v5-let-the-streets-run-red-what-we-know?p=1420274#post1420274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> It's already available to backers of the Kickstarter. It won't be available for general retail until the print on demand proof copies have been reviewed by us.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oooo.<br /> <br /> I didn't know it had been updated. Thank you. *goes to fetch it*<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T05:02:10-07:00","id":1420656,"title":"","content":"Some thoughts about the document as we await its POD release. I look forward to really hearing what everyone thinks about this.<br /> <br /> I should probably shut down this thread and open a new one.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <b>Power Play</b><br /> <br /> 1. I really like the fact the Chronicle doesn't try to overstate Redwood's threat. He's a threat to their Touchstones and possibly Mortal Identities but he's bitten off way more than he could chew. It's actually a situation where the best way to handle this is probably to brute force your way in and kill the guy. Mercy might make the situation worse because he's an abusive asshole who his family would be better off without (despite the fact he was driven to it).<br /> <br /> 2. I also like the implications that if you feed someone to NEAR death that they might still not make it or suffer brain damage. That's a neat little bit of realism inserted into the storyline.<br /> <br /> <b>Willerton</b><br /> <br /> 1. I like the expansion on the Goblin Roads that were introduced in BJD. Onyx Path is not letting any of their plots for that book lay fallow. Its weird because in my Tampa by Night game, we had the locals adjust the leylines to keep a 4th generation vampire asleep in the middle of the city so strange minds think alike.<br /> <br /> You could also make Willerton founded by Zellios.<br /> <br /> 2. Not defining the Harvest God was probably a smart move. Its probably a sleeping Kindred but could also be an Earthbound, Wyrm totem, or even the Goblin Roads themselves. Like a genius loci caern that the Garou just don't know about. If the PCs are smart, they'll never know. One possibility I may do is its Jacob and Esau and he's only been imprisoned in the town recently by the Goblin Roads, the locals rituals only feeding a vampire recently.<br /> <br /> <b>Milwaukee and Indianapolis</b><br /> <br /> 1. I like the fact that they inserted that Milwaukee's hellish police state for Kindred is actually something that makes it a really safe place for Kine. That actually adds a moral dimension to it that I hadn't thought about. Milwaukee is probably a place where if you kill a mortal without permission that you'll be executed.<br /> <br /> 2. I like how Julia Calvin and Honor contrast one another. Julia got Blood Bound, Embraced, and abused to no end by Decker in her write up. Now he's moved on to someone else. I feel like Julia could be a potential stalker and hope to send Honor to her final Death.<br /> <br /> 3. Is it weird I find Coach Tyrone Soras and Marion's romance sweet? It's incredibly humanizing for both and helps make Soras feel less like a Priest of Evil/Life Coach. I mean, it's doomed but sincere vampire romances are my jam.<br /> <br /> <b>Gary, Indiana</b><br /> <br /> Yeah, I know I have some thoughts here.<br /> <br /> 1. I like that Evelyn is now the new Baron of the City and probably will do a much better job than Juggler. I would have been interested in exploring that she should be leader than Juggler and his return would be a very bad thing. I also like Allicia and her relationship and would be interested in what they could do, especially if allied with Anita.<br /> <br /> 2. I really wish we had a Charlie write-up. I wonder if the writers will say what sort of vampire he is or was and his relationship to the existing Gary kindred.<br /> <br /> 3. Lucian was stated to have been Beckoned AND to have met a horrible end, I wonder what the story there is.<br /> <br /> 4. I feel like the ending should have the option of calling the Anarchs in on Maxwell, the Special Task Force, or Sullivan Dane. The PCs going after Maxwell alone are dumb but the calvary taking him down would be pretty epic.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-28-2020, 08:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theony